  "description": "U-Sin is an ordinary office worker who believed in romantic love stories. All the previous lovers he dated, believing they were fated attraction, turned out to be total jerks. Just as he turns a blind eye to fate and seeks stability, there is someone who keeps catching his eye. Once... twice... and then three times...? Is this encounter a coincidence, or is it destiny?\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
